abstract: "A vendor-neutral reference architecture and engineering artefact collection for governing agentic AI in IT Service Management, including tool contracts, OPA/Rego policies, evidence schemas with plan-hash binding and context-freshness admission, governance mappings, and an autonomy maturity model. Companion repository to the IEEE Software article 'Governed Agentic AI in IT Service Management'."
